time to avoid seafood altogether. It is the time to choose better seafood — lower in mercury, rich in omega-3s, and handled to a standard you can trust.<\/p><p>Your body is building an entirely new human, system by system. Clean seafood provides bioavailable omega-3 fats, protein, iodine, selenium, and vitamin D that support fetal brain and eye development, thyroid function, and maternal recovery. DHA alone accounts for 97% of omega-3 fats in the developing brain — sourced almost entirely from what the mother eats, transferred through the placenta.<\/p><p>The key is cleanliness. Nutrient-dense seafood delivers what pregnancy needs most, without the toxicological concerns associated with high-mercury or poorly controlled sources.<\/p>","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_font":"body","secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_PWTE8k":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Learn more about Seafood in Pregnancy","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/pregnancy-safe-seafood","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":false}}},"block_order":["heading_qCgiNe","text_7YJGYE","button_PWTE8k"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"custom_class":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Seatopia-39_517f34bc-2506-4f9b-8e3e-5bd5e4747ac2.jpg","image_height":"750px","image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","text_alignment":"left","content_position":"align-self-center","image_height_mobile":"auto","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_background_2":"","gradient_background_2":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":72,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"featured_product_aX7gBP":{"type":"fea